1
00:00:34,667 --> 00:00:35,973
关于基因改良过的星际战士
What's the best first-person shooter

2
00:00:35,973 --> 00:00:38,325
最棒的第一人称射击游戏是什么
about genetically modified space marines?

3
00:00:38,325 --> 00:00:39,661
侬好呀[光晕游戏]
Halo!

4
00:00:39,661 --> 00:00:40,229
亲爱的
Honey,

5
00:00:40,229 --> 00:00:42,183
你是不是玩了你新买的游戏一整天了
have you been playing your new little video game all day?

6
00:00:42,183 --> 00:00:44,216
你用这种语气说出来 表明卢克和我
When you say it in that tone, it implies that Luke and I

7
00:00:44,216 --> 00:00:45,681
没有好好共度父子亲密时光
haven't been spending quality time together.

8
00:00:45,681 --> 00:00:47,186
-其实是有的 -我能跟他说话吗
- Which we have. - Can I talk to him?

9
00:00:47,186 --> 00:00:49,310
当然了 卢克
Sure thing. Luke!

10
00:00:50,436 --> 00:00:51,512
我觉得他好像不在
I don't think he's here.

11
00:00:51,512 --> 00:00:53,426
我是说 我知道他不在
I mean, I-I know he's not here.

12
00:00:53,426 --> 00:00:54,014
他去哪儿了
Where is he?

13
00:00:54,014 --> 00:00:55,190
我相信他一定和他的小伙伴一起出去了
I am certain he is probably out with his usual crew of cut-ups.

14
00:00:58,031 --> 00:00:59,536
你没有洗衣服吧
You're not doing laundry, are you?

15
00:00:59,536 --> 00:01:01,839
没 但你叮嘱过的话 我马上就去洗
God, no. But I'm about to if I'm supposed to.

16
00:01:01,839 --> 00:01:02,975
不 不 不要洗
No, no. Don't. Don't.

17
00:01:02,975 --> 00:01:03,792
但你能在我回家前
But can you vacuum out

18
00:01:03,792 --> 00:01:05,068
把通风管道清理干净吗
the dryer vent before I get home?

19
00:01:05,068 --> 00:01:06,713
我一定会清理的
I will absolutely do that.

20
00:01:07,650 --> 00:01:08,657
谢了
Thanks.

21
00:01:11,078 --> 00:01:12,314
我联系不上海莉了
I can't get in touch with Haley.

22
00:01:12,314 --> 00:01:14,517
自从我们吵架后 我就没跟她说上话
I haven't talked to her since we got in that fight.

23
00:01:14,587 --> 00:01:15,175
她在吗
She around?

24
00:01:15,175 --> 00:01:17,139
我觉得她好像去朋友家过夜了
I think she slept at a friend's house.

25
00:01:17,139 --> 00:01:18,146
什么朋友
What friend?

26
00:01:19,561 --> 00:01:20,617
不是个常见的名字
Not a normal name,

27
00:01:20,617 --> 00:01:22,740
是元音开头的 很可能是个外国人
starts with a vowel, possibly foreign.

28
00:01:22,740 --> 00:01:25,153
或许艾丽克斯知道 她在家吗
Oh, maybe Alex knows. Is she home?

29
00:01:25,153 --> 00:01:27,943
不在 我已经好几个小时没见到她了
Nope. I have not seen her for hours.

30
00:01:27,953 --> 00:01:29,937
海莉认识个叫阿杰巴的人吗
Does Haley know an Arjibarge?

31
00:01:30,146 --> 00:01:32,279
-嗨 妈 -嗨 宝贝 你在哪儿呢
- Hi, mom. - Hi, honey. Where are you?

32
00:01:32,279 --> 00:01:33,725
我在厨房啊
I'm in the kitchen.

33
00:01:34,073 --> 00:01:36,147
艾丽克斯 你什么时候回家的啊
Alex? When'd you get home?

34
00:01:36,665 --> 00:01:38,340
我一整天都在家里啊
I've been here all day.

35
00:01:38,579 --> 00:01:39,825
你该多出去 呼吸下新鲜空气什么的
You should get outside, get some fresh air.

36
00:01:39,825 --> 00:01:40,881
现在是美好的清晨时光
It's a beautiful morning.

37
00:01:40,881 --> 00:01:42,496
都已经中午了 而且外面冷死了
It's noon, and it's freezing out.

38
00:01:42,496 --> 00:01:44,240
菲尔 亲爱的 我不在家时
Phil, honey, when I'm not home,

39
00:01:44,240 --> 00:01:47,111
我需要你站好岗 看好每一个孩子
I need you to be present and keep track of everyone.

40
00:01:47,211 --> 00:01:48,965
听上去很棒 我也爱你
Sounds good. Love you, too.

41
00:01:48,965 --> 00:01:50,899
艾丽克斯 你知道海莉去哪儿了吗
Alex, do you know where Haley is?

42
00:01:52,025 --> 00:01:53,899
我知道她昨晚去给莉莉当保姆了
I mean, I know she was babysitting Lily last night,

43
00:01:53,899 --> 00:01:55,434
但从那之后我就没见过她了
but I haven't seen her since.

44
00:01:55,434 --> 00:01:56,042
顺便说下
By the way,

45
00:01:56,042 --> 00:01:58,105
别看我昨晚发你的我大学申请论文的草稿
don't read the draft I sent you last night of my college essay.

46
00:01:58,105 --> 00:01:59,241
我刚刚又重新发给你了一份
I just sent you a new version.

47
00:01:59,241 --> 00:02:01,972
好的 我这就去看
Uh, okay. I will go read that one right now.

48
00:02:25,635 --> 00:02:27,848
天啊 你在干什么 你在拍我吗
Oh, my god. What are you doing? Are you filming me?

49
00:02:27,848 --> 00:02:30,888
是的 我想让你看看你的表现有多疯狂
Yes! I want you to see how crazy you are acting.

50
00:02:30,888 --> 00:02:33,749
我? 我去找你说一件很重要的事
Me?! I come to talk to you about something important,

51
00:02:33,749 --> 00:02:35,922
然后你就拿着摄像机跟着我狂拍
and then you start chasing me aound with the camera.

52
00:02:35,922 --> 00:02:37,995
我9小时前就吩咐过你打扫厨房了
I asked you to clean up the kitchen nine hours ago

53
00:02:37,995 --> 00:02:38,912
当时是我离家去上班时
when I left for work.

54
00:02:38,912 --> 00:02:40,955
等我下班回到家 发现还是脏乱的一片
I come back, and it's the exact same mess,

55
00:02:40,955 --> 00:02:42,480
还多了腌黄瓜和花生酱
plus pickles and peanut butter!

56
00:02:42,480 --> 00:02:46,417
我整天都得为我那个疯狂的老板做各种事
I was running around doing stuff for my crazy boss all day,

57
00:02:46,417 --> 00:02:47,404
然后我饿了
and then I got hungry,

58
00:02:47,404 --> 00:02:49,687
但垃圾桶里的臭味差点让我吐出来
and then the smell from the garbage almost made me throw up!

59
00:02:49,687 --> 00:02:50,913
我也是这种感觉
That's exactly how I feel!

60
00:02:50,913 --> 00:02:51,730
别烦我了
Leave me alone!

61
00:02:51,730 --> 00:02:52,986
我的烦心事已经够多的了[盘子上很多脏东西]
I have a lot on my plate!

62
00:02:52,986 --> 00:02:54,601
是的 是的 我看到了 亲爱的
Yes. Yes, I can see that, honey.

63
00:02:54,601 --> 00:02:55,498
你把脏盘子都堆在洗碗池里了
You left it in the sink!

64
00:02:55,498 --> 00:02:56,534
天啊
Oh, my god!

65
00:02:56,534 --> 00:03:00,412
我排了两小时的队 但总算买到了
I waited in line for two hours, but I got it.

66
00:03:00,412 --> 00:03:01,908
哎呀 我们在拍家庭录像吗
Ooh, we making a home movie?

67
00:03:25,390 --> 00:03:26,208
喂
Hello?

68
00:03:26,287 --> 00:03:27,285
你好 老爸
Hey, dad.

69
00:03:27,553 --> 00:03:29,497
爸 把手机从耳朵旁边拿下来
Dad, take the phone away from your ear.

70
00:03:29,756 --> 00:03:30,523
为什么要拿下来
Why would I do this?

71
00:03:30,523 --> 00:03:31,361
现在我听不到你说话了
Now I can't hear you.

72
00:03:31,361 --> 00:03:33,205
放在你面前
Put it in front of your face.

73
00:03:35,049 --> 00:03:36,394
你怎么跑到我手机里的
How'd you get in my phone?

74
00:03:36,823 --> 00:03:38,567
这是不是意味着那天我们通话时
Does this mean when we talked the other day

75
00:03:38,567 --> 00:03:40,062
你知道我是在厕所里
that you knew I was in the can?

76
00:03:40,062 --> 00:03:40,740
我这下知道了
I do now.

77
00:03:40,740 --> 00:03:41,956
会议展示做得怎么样
How was the presentation?

78
00:03:41,956 --> 00:03:42,883
非常顺利
Actually went really well.

79
00:03:42,883 --> 00:03:44,418
客户喜欢我们的新设计
The client loves the whole re-design.

80
00:03:44,418 --> 00:03:45,684
但希望我们换掉长方形把手
They just want us to swap out the handles --

81
00:03:45,684 --> 00:03:47,289
-该死的 -我懂的
- Damn it! - I know.

82
00:03:47,289 --> 00:03:49,013
只有蠢货才会想要旋钮
Only knobs want knobs.

83
00:03:49,013 --> 00:03:51,934
不是 是乔咬了我 他在出牙
No, Joe bit me. He's teething.

84
00:03:51,934 --> 00:03:53,219
我觉得安迪这周末请假
I don't think it's a coincidence

85
00:03:53,219 --> 00:03:54,894
不是巧合
that Andy took the weekend off.

86
00:03:55,572 --> 00:03:56,887
这孩子跟海狸似的
Kid's like a beaver.

87
00:03:56,887 --> 00:03:58,432
我都不敢穿短裤了
I'm afraid to wear short pants.

88
00:03:58,432 --> 00:04:00,047
好啊 克莱尔
Hola, Claire.

89
00:04:00,047 --> 00:04:00,844
好啊 歌洛莉亚
Hey, Gloria.

90
00:04:00,844 --> 00:04:03,147
出差怎么样 玩得开心吗
How's your trip? Are you having any fun?

91
00:04:03,147 --> 00:04:07,323
是啊 风有点大 但是
Uh...yeah. You know, it's a little windy, but, eh.

92
00:04:07,323 --> 00:04:09,735
你同意我帮卢克剪头发吧
So, you're okay with me cutting Luke's hair, right?

93
00:04:09,735 --> 00:04:11,151
-妈妈 -好啊
- Hey, mom. - Well, hello.

94
00:04:11,151 --> 00:04:13,284
知道你没死在某个小巷里真是太好了
It's nice to know you're not dead in an alley somewhere.

95
00:04:13,284 --> 00:04:14,601
你也是
Right back at you.

96
00:04:14,639 --> 00:04:16,214
我同意你剪他的头发
Yes, I am fine with you cutting his hair.

97
00:04:16,214 --> 00:04:18,118
两边别留太长就行
Just don't leave it too long on the sides.

98
00:04:18,118 --> 00:04:20,450
我很擅长剪男孩的头发
I am very good cutting boys' hair.

99
00:04:20,450 --> 00:04:22,464
你以后该让我剪你的
You should let me cut yours someday.

100
00:04:22,464 --> 00:04:24,836
好吧 再见 歌洛莉亚
Okay, bye-bye, Gloria.

101
00:04:26,341 --> 00:04:27,598
你还在吗
You still there?

102
00:04:28,823 --> 00:04:30,508
该死 爸 你知道今天是
Crap. Dad, did you know

103
00:04:30,508 --> 00:04:31,604
米奇尔的生日吗
it was Mitchell's birthday today?

104
00:04:31,604 --> 00:04:33,219
当然啦 我已经给他打了电话
Of course. I already called him

105
00:04:33,219 --> 00:04:34,764
因为我是个体贴周到的人
because I'm a considerate person

106
00:04:34,764 --> 00:04:36,628
对家人由衷地关心
who really cares about his family.

107
00:04:36,628 --> 00:04:38,880
是我提醒的他 我拨的电话
I reminded him and dialed the phone.

108
00:04:39,030 --> 00:04:39,957
旅途顺利
Fly safe.

109
00:04:39,957 --> 00:04:41,611
记住你可以向后靠[倒退]
And remember you can recline.

110
00:04:41,611 --> 00:04:43,196
到了天上也还是美国
It's still America up there.

111
00:04:43,196 --> 00:04:44,542
谢了 老爸
Thanks, dad.

112
00:04:53,453 --> 00:04:54,669
生日快乐
Happy birthday!

113
00:04:54,669 --> 00:04:56,951
好啊 还是我的生日吗
Oh, hey. Is it still my birthday?

114
00:04:56,951 --> 00:04:58,716
小心点 不然我要唱歌了
Watch it, or I'll sing to you.

115
00:04:58,716 --> 00:05:00,699
-生... -好吧 我认输
-Ha-- - Okay, okay, I give.

116
00:05:00,699 --> 00:05:03,051
好吧 你今天过得好吗
Okay. So, have you had a good day?

117
00:05:03,051 --> 00:05:03,919
不错 谢谢
Yes, thank you.

118
00:05:03,919 --> 00:05:04,806
莉莉
Uh, Lily,

119
00:05:04,806 --> 00:05:07,497
她给我做了她拿手的巧克力豆炒蛋
she made me her famous chocolate-chip scrambled eggs...

120
00:05:07,497 --> 00:05:10,039
她还看着我吃了下去
...which she then watched me eat.

121
00:05:10,288 --> 00:05:10,826
是的
Yeah.

122
00:05:10,826 --> 00:05:12,221
你收到我的礼物了吧
You got my present, didn't you?

123
00:05:12,221 --> 00:05:12,740
没有
No.

124
00:05:12,740 --> 00:05:15,032
该死 他们跟我保证会按时送到
Darn it. They promised it would be there on time.

125
00:05:15,032 --> 00:05:16,198
我等不及拆开礼物
Oh, well, I can't wait to open it

126
00:05:16,198 --> 00:05:18,023
看看发票上的日期了
and check the date on the invoice.

127
00:05:18,142 --> 00:05:19,258
-那是克莱尔吗 -是
- Hey, is that Claire? - Yeah.

128
00:05:19,258 --> 00:05:20,793
-好啊 克莱尔 -好啊
- Hi, Claire! - Hi.

129
00:05:20,793 --> 00:05:23,255
你给她看了我的礼物吗
Hi. Hey, uh, did you, uh, show her my gift yet?

130
00:05:23,255 --> 00:05:23,873
没有
No.

131
00:05:23,873 --> 00:05:25,887
-快给她看啊 -好的 好
- Come on, show her, show her. - Okay. Yeah.

132
00:05:25,887 --> 00:05:26,825
超棒
It's good.

133
00:05:29,655 --> 00:05:32,595
您好 生日快乐[模仿犹太人]
Wow, shalom and chh-appy birthday.

134
00:05:32,595 --> 00:05:33,492
就是啊
I know, right?

135
00:05:33,492 --> 00:05:35,167
很棒吧
Isn't it fantastic?

136
00:05:35,167 --> 00:05:36,981
克莱尔 你给我买加勒特奶酪
Hey, Claire, did you get me some Garrett's cheese

137
00:05:36,981 --> 00:05:37,609
和焦糖味爆米花了吗
and caramel corn yet?

138
00:05:37,609 --> 00:05:39,004
糟糕 我忘了
Oh, shoot, I forgot.

139
00:05:39,004 --> 00:05:41,645
你在芝加哥就只用做这件事啊
It's the one thing you had to do in Chicago!

140
00:05:41,645 --> 00:05:42,543
你太对了
You are so right.

141
00:05:42,543 --> 00:05:45,523
很抱歉 我因为工作分心了
I'm sorry that I let myself get distracted by my job.

142
00:05:45,523 --> 00:05:47,606
我要的是甜中带咸 克莱尔
Okay, I'm looking for sweet and salty, Claire,

143
00:05:47,606 --> 00:05:48,464
不是苦的[尖酸]
not bitter.

144
00:05:52,450 --> 00:05:53,108
别激动 小卡
Relax, Cam.

145
00:05:53,108 --> 00:05:55,092
这里肯定有小卖部卖那个
I'm sure there's a kiosk around here that sells it.

146
00:05:55,092 --> 00:05:55,420
那就好
Good.

147
00:05:55,420 --> 00:05:57,544
听着 昨天海莉有没有提起过
Guys, listen, yesterday, did Haley mention

148
00:05:57,544 --> 00:05:59,437
她照看莉莉之后要去哪里
where she was gonna go after she babysat for Lily?

149
00:05:59,437 --> 00:06:01,082
没有 但你找到她时
No, but when you do talk to her,

150
00:06:01,082 --> 00:06:01,610
能不能告诉她
can you tell her

151
00:06:01,610 --> 00:06:03,225
让她小心对待我的粉蓝色西装
to please be careful with my powder-blue suit

152
00:06:03,225 --> 00:06:05,438
那是小卡未经我同意借给她的
that Cam let her borrow without asking me?

153
00:06:05,438 --> 00:06:06,355
她为什么需要西装
Why did she want a suit?

154
00:06:06,355 --> 00:06:07,900
她的一个朋友参加婚礼用的
A friend of hers needs it for a wedding,

155
00:06:07,900 --> 00:06:08,597
米奇尔得摆脱
and Mitchell needs to stop

156
00:06:08,597 --> 00:06:10,591
"理发店四重唱"的造型
dressing like he's in a barbershop quartet.

157
00:06:10,591 --> 00:06:11,388
莉莉 亲爱的
Lily, honey,

158
00:06:11,388 --> 00:06:13,621
海莉离开时有没有说她要去哪里
did Haley say where she was going when she left here?

159
00:06:13,621 --> 00:06:15,226
-谁想知道 -克莱尔姑妈
- Who wants to know? - Aunt Claire.

160
00:06:15,226 --> 00:06:17,598
克莱尔姑妈 听说你对海莉很刻薄
Hey, Aunt Claire. I heard you were being mean to Haley.

161
00:06:17,598 --> 00:06:18,874
我没对海莉很刻薄
I was not mean to Haley.

162
00:06:18,874 --> 00:06:20,249
行了 你在嚷嚷
Okay, you're screaming.

163
00:06:20,249 --> 00:06:22,303
我不知道她去了哪里 也许迪兰知道
I don't know where she went. Maybe Dylan knows.

164
00:06:22,303 --> 00:06:23,748
迪兰 他怎么会知道
Dylan? Why would Dylan know?

165
00:06:23,748 --> 00:06:25,851
他来过 他们在沙发上说话
He came over, and they were talking on the couch

166
00:06:25,851 --> 00:06:27,914
我那时候在另一间房里
while I was in the other room...

167
00:06:28,622 --> 00:06:30,167
很乖的
behaving.

168
00:06:30,626 --> 00:06:33,277
她还在跟迪兰说话吗 真的吗
She's still talking to Dylan? Really?

169
00:06:33,357 --> 00:06:34,672
等等 我得挂了
Oh, wait, guys, I got to go.

170
00:06:34,672 --> 00:06:37,483
生日快乐 芭芭拉[《燕特尔》主演]
Uh, happy birthday, Babs.

171
00:06:37,623 --> 00:06:39,008
那是什么意思
What does she mean by that?

172
00:06:40,792 --> 00:06:41,580
亲爱的
Hi, honey.

173
00:06:41,580 --> 00:06:42,955
别读上一封草稿
Oh, don't read that last draft.

174
00:06:42,955 --> 00:06:44,660
我刚改了第三段
I just changed something in paragraph three.

175
00:06:44,660 --> 00:06:46,484
真糟糕
Oh, oh, that's too bad.

176
00:06:46,484 --> 00:06:47,032
第三段有我最喜欢的...
Paragraph three had some of my favorite --

177
00:06:47,032 --> 00:06:48,178
拜托 我能看见你的眼睛
Oh, please, I can see your eyes

178
00:06:48,178 --> 00:06:48,836
在飞快浏览屏幕
darting around the screen.

179
00:06:48,836 --> 00:06:50,261
读新的那篇就好
Just read the new one.

180
00:06:50,640 --> 00:06:53,252
你能不能帮我个忙 给你姐姐打电话
Can you just do me a favor and call your sister?

181
00:06:53,521 --> 00:06:55,704
如果她在屏蔽来电 我肯定打不进去
If she's screening, I'm not making the cut.

182
00:06:55,953 --> 00:06:57,299
你何不偷窥她的Facebook页面
Why don't you just snoop on her facebook page

183
00:06:57,299 --> 00:06:58,675
用你的假个人主页
with your fake profile?

184
00:07:00,717 --> 00:07:02,531
我没有假的个人主页
I don't have a fake profile.

185
00:07:02,531 --> 00:07:05,023
妈你算了吧 布罗迪·肯德尔刚上线了
Mom, save it. Brody Kendall just logged in.

186
00:07:05,023 --> 00:07:06,219
这种把戏也许能骗骗海莉
That trick might've worked on Haley,

187
00:07:06,219 --> 00:07:08,183
但我知道照片是察琪的
but I know that's a picture of Chachi.

188
00:07:09,808 --> 00:07:10,954
天呐 不是吧
Oh, my God. What?

189
00:07:10,954 --> 00:07:12,628
告诉我这不过是个错误
Please tell me that's some kind of mistake!

190
00:07:12,628 --> 00:07:14,243
哪里 哪一段
Where? Which paragraph?

191
00:07:14,243 --> 00:07:15,739
去叫你爸来 马上
Get your father -- now!

192
00:07:15,988 --> 00:07:17,114
爸 老妈找你
Dad, mom needs you!

193
00:07:17,114 --> 00:07:18,670
告诉她我在洗澡
Tell her I'm in the shower!

194
00:07:23,084 --> 00:07:25,078
亲爱的 我们该打给谁 该怎么办
Honey, who do we call? What do we do?

195
00:07:25,078 --> 00:07:27,420
海莉怎么可能结婚了
There's no way Haley's married.

196
00:07:27,420 --> 00:07:29,184
那她为什么换了Facebook的状态
Then why did she change her Facebook status?

197
00:07:29,184 --> 00:07:30,211
她应该没有吧
She probably didn't.

198
00:07:30,211 --> 00:07:32,783
可能是电脑的问题 有人黑了她的账号
It could be a computer glitch, someone hacked her account.

199
00:07:32,783 --> 00:07:35,653
我觉得在知道真相前我们都该冷静点
I just think we should stay calm until we know the story.

200
00:07:35,653 --> 00:07:39,212
亲爱的 失去联系又不清楚情况
Honey, I cannot get on a plane for four hours

201
00:07:39,212 --> 00:07:41,684
你叫我怎么在飞机上待四个小时
and be out of touch and not know what happened!

202
00:07:42,062 --> 00:07:43,528
不只是Facebook
It's not just the Facebook thing.

203
00:07:43,528 --> 00:07:46,209
她从米奇尔那里借了一件婚礼用的蓝西装
She borrowed a blue suit from Mitchell for a wedding.

204
00:07:46,209 --> 00:07:47,375
借来的 蓝色的[婚礼习俗]
Something borrowed, something blue?

205
00:07:47,375 --> 00:07:48,043
你意识到了吗
Do you get it?

206
00:07:48,043 --> 00:07:49,727
她要嫁给谁呢
Who would she even marry?

207
00:07:49,967 --> 00:07:51,741
我不知道 但她昨天跟迪兰在一起
I don't know, but she was with Dylan yesterday,

208
00:07:51,741 --> 00:07:53,405
如果她要跟他结婚
and if she was gonna marry him,

209
00:07:53,405 --> 00:07:55,389
她肯定不会告诉我们
she would definitely hide that from us.

210
00:07:55,389 --> 00:07:58,080
可是说不通啊 他为什么不打给我
But that makes no sense. Why wouldn't he call me?

211
00:07:59,854 --> 00:08:01,838
-你好 邓太太 -你好 迪兰
- Oh, hey, Mrs. "D". - Hey, Dylan!

212
00:08:01,838 --> 00:08:03,074
你好 邓先生
Oh, hi, Mr. "D"!

213
00:08:03,074 --> 00:08:05,177
-你跟海莉在一起吗 -以什么方式
- Are you with Haley? - In what way?

214
00:08:05,177 --> 00:08:07,759
现实中 浪漫里 婚姻性质地
Physically, romantically, maritally?

215
00:08:07,759 --> 00:08:10,868
不 我在工作呢 我有事业了
No. I'm at work. I have a career now.

216
00:08:11,048 --> 00:08:13,330
你能帮我拿一下电话吗
Hey, uh, can you hold this phone for a second?

217
00:08:18,414 --> 00:08:20,318
所以你不知道海莉现在在哪里
So, you have no idea where Haley is right now?

218
00:08:20,318 --> 00:08:23,298
你是说精神上 还是地理上
You mean spiritually, geographically?

219
00:08:23,298 --> 00:08:24,933
你能别转那个广告牌了吗
Can you please stop spinning that sign?

220
00:08:24,933 --> 00:08:26,727
不行 我老板说我要是停了
No. My boss says if I do,

221
00:08:26,727 --> 00:08:29,238
他就找个那种人来取代我
he'll replace me with one of those guys!

222
00:08:29,856 --> 00:08:32,239
回你来的地方去
Go back to where you came from!

223
00:08:32,239 --> 00:08:33,574
迪兰 看着我
Dylan, focus!

224
00:08:33,574 --> 00:08:35,000
我不知道她在哪
I don't know where she is,

225
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:37,173
不过我能感觉到她没事
but I can sense that she's okay.

226
00:08:37,173 --> 00:08:38,857
就像我们共用一个大脑一样
It's like we share the same brain.

227
00:08:38,857 --> 00:08:40,173
现在脑子在谁那
Who has it now?

228
00:08:40,173 --> 00:08:41,827
好了 昨晚你跟她在一起时
Okay, so, last night when you were with her,

229
00:08:41,827 --> 00:08:44,240
她完全没说要结婚的事吗
she didn't say anything about getting married?

230
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:47,648
海莉结婚了吗 太让人伤心了
Haley got married?! That's so upsetting!

231
00:08:48,306 --> 00:08:49,224
好了
Done.

232
00:08:57,307 --> 00:08:59,490
-妈 -你有海莉的iCloud密码吗
- Hi, mom. - Do you have Haley's iCloud Password?

233
00:08:59,490 --> 00:09:01,154
是的 她放在一个小信封里
Yeah, she gave it to me in a little envelope

234
00:09:01,154 --> 00:09:01,882
跟她的日记本钥匙
with her diary key

235
00:09:01,882 --> 00:09:03,865
以及最怕的事物清单一起交给了我
and a list of things she's most afraid of.

236
00:09:04,523 --> 00:09:05,500
也许我们能猜出来
Maybe we could guess it.

237
00:09:05,500 --> 00:09:07,922
克莱尔 你不小心把电话挂了
Claire, you accidentally hung up on me.

238
00:09:07,922 --> 00:09:10,255
对 亲爱的 你知道我不太会用电脑
Oh, yeah, well, honey, you know me and computers.

239
00:09:10,255 --> 00:09:11,959
妈妈在猜海莉的iCloud密码
Mom's trying to guess Haley's iCloud password.

240
00:09:11,959 --> 00:09:15,069
个人觉得这侵犯了她的隐私
Which, personally, I think is an invasion of her privacy.

241
00:09:15,388 --> 00:09:16,924
试试看"密码"行不行
Ooh, try "Password."

242
00:09:18,996 --> 00:09:20,033
还好不是这个
I'm kind of glad that didn't work.

243
00:09:20,033 --> 00:09:21,777
等等 我记得我告诉过她
Wait, I think I remember telling her to use something

244
00:09:21,777 --> 00:09:22,844
要用别人不知道的东西做密码
that people wouldn't know about her,

245
00:09:22,844 --> 00:09:24,927
比如她最喜欢的文学形象
like her favorite literary character.

246
00:09:27,299 --> 00:09:27,797
进去了
I'm in!

247
00:09:27,797 --> 00:09:29,093
不是吧 是什么
What? What was it?

248
00:09:29,093 --> 00:09:30,171
史努比[爱窥探的]
Snoopy.

249
00:09:30,409 --> 00:09:31,535
可以当你的新外号了
And that could be your new nickname.

250
00:09:31,535 --> 00:09:34,735
好吧 寻找我的iPhone
Okay. Find my iPhone.

251
00:09:36,439 --> 00:09:38,014
不是吧 她在拉斯维加斯
Oh, no! She's in Vegas.

252
00:09:38,014 --> 00:09:38,801
你没开玩笑吧
Are you serious?

253
00:09:38,801 --> 00:09:40,466
等等 我在放大 等等 等等
Oh, hang on. I'm zooming in. Hold on, hold on.

254
00:09:40,466 --> 00:09:41,871
我来看看...
Let me see what I can, uh...

255
00:09:43,576 --> 00:09:44,932
快点
Come on.

256
00:09:46,237 --> 00:09:47,713
天呐
And -- oh, God!

257
00:09:47,792 --> 00:09:49,965
亲爱的 她在一间婚礼教堂里
Honey, she's at a wedding chapel!

258
00:09:49,965 --> 00:09:52,277
好吧 是有点麻烦 但是你想想
Okay, that's troubling, but think about it.

259
00:09:52,277 --> 00:09:54,251
如果她没跟迪兰在一起 她能跟谁结婚
If she's not with Dylan, who would she be marrying?

260
00:09:54,251 --> 00:09:54,779
我不知道
I don't know!

261
00:09:54,779 --> 00:09:56,404
艾丽克斯 她一定跟你说过什么
Alex, she had to have told you something!

262
00:09:56,404 --> 00:09:58,706
好吧 我们确实不亲密
Okay, you are really rubbing in our lack of closeness.

263
00:09:58,706 --> 00:10:00,371
她连用什么护发素都不会告诉我
She won't even tell me what conditioner she uses.

264
00:10:00,371 --> 00:10:02,823
我只有12分钟了 赶紧想
I have 12 minutes! Think!

265
00:10:03,730 --> 00:10:04,836
我不知道 去问米尔奇舅舅吧
I don't know. Ask uncle Mitchell.

266
00:10:04,836 --> 00:10:06,860
她们总是聊男孩子的事
They're always giggling about boys.

267
00:10:07,019 --> 00:10:08,335
好 我这就找他
Oh, good! Okay, yes, I'm gonna do that.

268
00:10:08,335 --> 00:10:09,073
我打给他
I'm calling him.

269
00:10:09,073 --> 00:10:09,571
要是有用
If it helps,

270
00:10:09,571 --> 00:10:12,272
我可以找我在赌城的魔术师朋友
I can alert my magician contacts in Vegas.

271
00:10:12,442 --> 00:10:14,455
尽管他们更擅长让女孩消失
Although, they are better at making girls disappear

272
00:10:14,455 --> 00:10:16,071
而不是把她们找出来
than they are finding them.

273
00:10:18,123 --> 00:10:18,971
什么事
What?

274
00:10:19,239 --> 00:10:21,123
莉莉 亲爱的 去帮我叫米奇尔
Lily, honey, I need you get Mitchell.

275
00:10:21,123 --> 00:10:23,695
他们说我能玩20分钟iPad
But they said I could have 20 minute of iPad time.

276
00:10:23,695 --> 00:10:24,548
米奇尔 米奇尔
Mitchell? Mitchell?!

277
00:10:24,548 --> 00:10:27,384
怎么了
Hey, what's up?

278
00:10:27,871 --> 00:10:29,317
我得跟米奇尔谈谈
I-I really need to talk to Mitchell.

279
00:10:29,317 --> 00:10:31,470
现在是我的iPad时间
It's my iPad time!

280
00:10:31,470 --> 00:10:33,373
宝贝 关于自私这事我怎么跟你说的
Honey, what did I tell you about being selfish?

281
00:10:33,373 --> 00:10:34,948
只要克莱尔姨妈买到我要的爆米花
Aunt Claire needs to speak to other daddy

282
00:10:34,948 --> 00:10:36,802
她就能跟二爸说话啦
just as soon as she gets me my popcorn.

283
00:10:36,802 --> 00:10:38,756
什么 小卡 我说过了
What? You, Cam, I promise you,

284
00:10:38,756 --> 00:10:40,570
我会给你买到爆米花的
I will get you your popcorn,

285
00:10:40,570 --> 00:10:42,234
但现在我得跟米奇尔谈谈
but right now, I need to talk to Mitchell!

286
00:10:42,234 --> 00:10:43,819
-奶酪和焦糖味的 -知道了
- Okay, cheese and caramel. - Fine.

287
00:10:43,819 --> 00:10:44,746
-还有焦糖味的 -记住了
- And caramel. - Fine.

288
00:10:44,746 --> 00:10:45,514
怎么了
Hey, what's up?

289
00:10:45,514 --> 00:10:49,102
我很确定海莉在赌城结婚了
So, I'm pretty sure that Haley is getting married in Vegas.

290
00:10:49,102 --> 00:10:49,850
-你说什么 -什么
- What?! - What?!

291
00:10:49,850 --> 00:10:51,654
我要知道她在和谁约会
Yeah, I need to know who she's been dating.

292
00:10:52,022 --> 00:10:53,577
她说过自己可能喜欢上了
T-there was this one guy who she thought

293
00:10:53,577 --> 00:10:55,571
这么一个人 但我也不清楚
that she might like, but, I don't know.

294
00:10:55,571 --> 00:10:57,116
她对于他一直藏着掖着
She was weirdly secretive about him,

295
00:10:57,116 --> 00:10:59,548
我觉得那个人算一个约会对象吧
but I-I guess that could still be thing.

296
00:10:59,548 --> 00:11:01,651
等等 老爸打电话来了
Oh, hang on, hang on, getting a call from dad.

297
00:11:03,455 --> 00:11:04,553
快做
Do the thing.

298
00:11:05,180 --> 00:11:06,475
做那个可爱的动作
Do the cute thing.

299
00:11:06,475 --> 00:11:07,990
-爸 -克莱尔
- Dad? - Claire?

300
00:11:07,990 --> 00:11:09,606
-爸 -米奇尔
- Dad? - Mitchell?

301
00:11:09,854 --> 00:11:10,592
你们在我手机里做什么
What are you doing in my phone?

302
00:11:10,592 --> 00:11:11,499
你打给我的 老爸
You called me, dad.

303
00:11:11,499 --> 00:11:13,512
我没有 我在跟乔拍视频
No, I didn't. I'm shooting a video with Joe.

304
00:11:13,512 --> 00:11:15,277
我现在在你的厨房里吗
Am I in your kitchen with you?

305
00:11:15,476 --> 00:11:15,984
不在
No.

306
00:11:15,984 --> 00:11:17,709
所以你没在跟乔拍视频
Then you're not shooting a video with Joe.

307
00:11:17,709 --> 00:11:21,127
杰 你好 克莱尔要去办点事
Hi, Jay! Claire was just about to go run an errand!

308
00:11:21,277 --> 00:11:21,905
没搞错吧
Are you kidding me?!

309
00:11:21,905 --> 00:11:23,759
天呐 等着
Okay, for God sakes. Hold--

310
00:11:23,759 --> 00:11:25,663
能麻烦您帮我看一下电脑吗
would you mind watching my computer for me for a minute?

311
00:11:25,663 --> 00:11:27,846
-非常感谢 -不客气
- Thank you so much. - Of course, dear.

312
00:11:28,533 --> 00:11:30,696
米奇尔 我喜欢这顶新帽子
Hey, Mitch, I'm liking the new hat.

313
00:11:30,706 --> 00:11:33,098
-让你看起来不一样了 -你想说什么
- It gives you some presence. - What you getting at, dad?

314
00:11:33,098 --> 00:11:34,294
没想说什么啊 就是很硬汉
Nothing. It's a strong look.

315
00:11:34,294 --> 00:11:37,006
你看起来像以前西部片里的型男
Y-you like one of those tough guys in an old western movie.

316
00:11:37,006 --> 00:11:38,122
-真的吗 -真的
- Really? - Yeah.

317
00:11:38,122 --> 00:11:40,165
这个帽子有点反派气息
Oh, I guess it is kind of badass.

318
00:11:40,165 --> 00:11:41,740
如果我把它往后折一点呢
What if I tilt it a little bit?

319
00:11:41,740 --> 00:11:42,808
那就毁了
You ruined it.

320
00:11:43,176 --> 00:11:45,259
我喜欢你的帽子 很配
I like your hat. It suits you.

321
00:11:45,259 --> 00:11:46,385
谢谢你 女士
Oh, thank you, ma'am.

322
00:11:46,385 --> 00:11:47,372
不客气
Well, you're welcome.

323
00:11:47,372 --> 00:11:48,669
谢谢你
Okay, thank you.

324
00:11:49,006 --> 00:11:51,698
把你改变人生的爆米花买回来了
All right, got your life-changing popcorn.

325
00:11:51,698 --> 00:11:52,775
真棒
Yes!

326
00:11:52,964 --> 00:11:55,595
能说回海莉结婚这件事了吗
Now, can we get back to figuring out who Haley married?

327
00:11:55,595 --> 00:11:56,392
海莉结婚了
Haley got married?!

328
00:11:56,392 --> 00:11:58,326
千万别是跟杰克逊
Oh my gosh, I hope it was no to Jackson.

329
00:11:58,326 --> 00:11:59,094
杰克逊
Jackson!

330
00:11:59,094 --> 00:12:02,203
他喜欢很奇怪的...食物
He was into some weird food.

331
00:12:02,203 --> 00:12:02,791
完蛋了
Oh, God!

332
00:12:02,791 --> 00:12:05,921
海莉结婚了 她麻烦大了
Whoa, Haley got married?! She is in so much trouble!

333
00:12:05,921 --> 00:12:07,566
卢克 你的头发怎么了
Luke, what have you done to your hair?!

334
00:12:07,566 --> 00:12:09,280
克莱尔 你这种反应
Claire, when you react like this,

335
00:12:09,280 --> 00:12:11,104
正是他想看到的
you're just giving him what he wants.

336
00:12:11,174 --> 00:12:13,068
卢克说你知道的
Luke said that you knew about it!

337
00:12:13,068 --> 00:12:14,792
我不知道
I didn't know about it!

338
00:12:14,792 --> 00:12:16,895
我说有家长知道
I said a parent knew about it.

339
00:12:16,895 --> 00:12:18,073
菲尔
Phil!

340
00:12:21,630 --> 00:12:22,577
我知道还没到这步
I know we're not there yet,

341
00:12:22,577 --> 00:12:24,012
但我在网上搜了婚姻无效条约
but I've been researching annulments.

342
00:12:24,012 --> 00:12:25,009
就要到这步了
Oh, we are there

343
00:12:25,009 --> 00:12:27,321
因为你同意他剪莫霍克发型
because you let our child get a Mohawk!

344
00:12:28,418 --> 00:12:29,426
真棒
Sweet!

345
00:12:29,514 --> 00:12:31,099
我们打了个赌
We...had a bet.

346
00:12:31,099 --> 00:12:32,983
他赢了你就让他留这头型吗
You let him get a Mohawk because he won a bet?!

347
00:12:32,983 --> 00:12:34,578
-他输了 -什么 菲尔
- No, he lost the bet. - What?! Phil!

348
00:12:34,578 --> 00:12:36,761
难道你想让我留莫霍克发型吗
Well, I-I, would you rather I had a Mohawk?

349
00:12:36,761 --> 00:12:38,585
-我可是要上班的 -我没时间争论
- I have a career. - I-I don't have time for this.

350
00:12:38,585 --> 00:12:39,681
我们得搞清楚
We've got to get back to figuring out

351
00:12:39,681 --> 00:12:40,827
海莉在赌城和谁结的婚
who Haley has married in Vegas.

352
00:12:40,827 --> 00:12:42,871
-有人敲门 -好吧
- Hold on. Someone's at the door.- Okay.

353
00:12:43,060 --> 00:12:44,087
海莉在赌城吗
So, Haley's in Vegas?

354
00:12:44,087 --> 00:12:46,050
-对 -你想的话 我可以打给安迪
- Yes. - If you want, I can call Andy.

355
00:12:46,050 --> 00:12:48,283
他也在 也许他能找到她
He's there, too. Maybe he can find her.

356
00:12:48,303 --> 00:12:49,340
安迪在赌城
Andy's in Vegas?

357
00:12:49,340 --> 00:12:50,835
是啊 他问我借了袖扣
Yeah, he borrowed some cuff links

358
00:12:50,835 --> 00:12:52,011
说是婚礼要用
from me for some wedding.

359
00:12:52,011 --> 00:12:52,998
天呐
Oh, my God,

360
00:12:52,998 --> 00:12:54,981
海莉不会嫁给安迪了吧
you guys don't think that Haley married Andy, do you?

361
00:12:54,981 --> 00:12:57,074
-海莉嫁给了安迪 -什么
- Haley married Andy! - What?!

362
00:12:57,074 --> 00:12:59,696
-他又赌输了什么 -不 不
- What bet did he lose? - No, no, no, no, no, no.

363
00:12:59,696 --> 00:13:01,490
安迪在和犹他州那女孩约会
Andy is dating some girl in Utah,

364
00:13:01,490 --> 00:13:02,747
海莉知道的
and Haley knows that.

365
00:13:02,786 --> 00:13:04,440
就算海莉喜欢他
Even if Haley was attracted to him,

366
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:06,025
我也希望她有点自尊心
I would hope she would have the decency

367
00:13:06,025 --> 00:13:06,543
和自控能力
and the self-control--

368
00:13:06,543 --> 00:13:08,686
天呐 她嫁给了安迪
Oh, my God! Oh, my god, she married Andy!

369
00:13:08,686 --> 00:13:09,863
我就知道她还喜欢他
I knew she was still into him.

370
00:13:09,863 --> 00:13:11,856
她说他俩不合适 但我就说
She said he wasn't her type, but I'm like,

371
00:13:11,866 --> 00:13:14,398
"他是个男的 有呼吸的男的"
"He's a man. He's breathing."

372
00:13:14,936 --> 00:13:16,989
也许这就是她不和我聊天的原因
Maybe this is why she doesn't talk to me about things.

373
00:13:16,989 --> 00:13:20,538
不可能是他 他是个好小伙
No, it can't be him. He's a very nice boy.

374
00:13:20,538 --> 00:13:21,853
克莱尔 相信我
Claire, trust me,

375
00:13:21,853 --> 00:13:24,445
安迪不会和海莉私奔的
Andy's not gonna run off and elope with Haley.

376
00:13:24,445 --> 00:13:25,920
他是个正直的人
He's a stand-up guy.

377
00:13:25,920 --> 00:13:27,993
-是寄给海莉的包裹 -打开
- It's a package for haley. - Open it.

378
00:13:27,993 --> 00:13:29,668
这侵犯她隐...
Well, that seems like an invasion of her priv--

379
00:13:29,668 --> 00:13:31,651
打开
Open it!

380
00:13:35,359 --> 00:13:37,333
《孕期指南》
"What to expect when you're expecting."

381
00:13:37,333 --> 00:13:38,738
老天啊
Oh, my god!

382
00:13:38,738 --> 00:13:40,921
我就说他是个正"直"的男人
I told you he was a stand-up guy.

383
00:13:48,955 --> 00:13:50,031
她不接电话 菲尔
She's not answering, phil.

384
00:13:50,031 --> 00:13:50,829
你在给安迪打电话吗
Are you calling andy?

385
00:13:50,829 --> 00:13:52,713
直接转到语音信箱了
It's going straight to voice mail.

386
00:13:53,640 --> 00:13:54,916
我不敢相信她怀孕了
I can't believe she's pregnant.

387
00:13:54,916 --> 00:13:57,039
别轻易下结论
Let's not jump to any conclusions.

388
00:13:57,039 --> 00:13:58,992
轻易吗 来回顾一下
Jump? Let's review.

389
00:13:58,992 --> 00:14:01,135
她情绪暴躁 吃奇怪的东西
She's been moody, eating weird food,

390
00:14:01,135 --> 00:14:02,242
恶心反胃
getting nauseous.

391
00:14:02,242 --> 00:14:03,667
她半夜离家
She left in the middle of the night

392
00:14:03,667 --> 00:14:05,750
和秘密爱人跑去拉斯维加斯小教堂
for a wedding chapel in vegas with her secret love,

393
00:14:05,750 --> 00:14:09,129
还有最可疑的是 她买了一本书
and most suspicious of all, she bought a book!

394
00:14:09,129 --> 00:14:12,289
糟了 如果你是对的该怎么办
Oh, no. What if you're right?

395
00:14:12,289 --> 00:14:13,724
-我们该怎么做 -我不知道
- What will we do? - I don't know.

396
00:14:13,724 --> 00:14:14,512
我要灭了那个安迪
I'll kill that Andy.

397
00:14:14,512 --> 00:14:16,415
他怎么能这么不负责任
How could he be so irresponsible?

398
00:14:16,804 --> 00:14:18,289
他虽然是个好人
I mean, he's a good kid.

399
00:14:18,658 --> 00:14:19,924
他怎么能就这么拐走我的女儿
But to run off with my baby girl

400
00:14:19,924 --> 00:14:22,486
之前还让我迷上他的"道歉"表演
after I fell for his "Aw, shucks" act!

401
00:14:22,486 --> 00:14:24,888
也可能不是表演 因为他人很好
Which is probably not an act because he's genuinely nice

402
00:14:24,888 --> 00:14:26,572
还有他觉得那是脏话
and he thinks "Shucks" is the "S" word.

403
00:14:26,572 --> 00:14:28,037
我还是想灭了他
Still, I want to kill him!

404
00:14:28,037 --> 00:14:29,333
但我的外孙可能就
But that would be robbing my grandchild

405
00:14:29,333 --> 00:14:30,858
没了一个超棒的爸爸
of probably a really great father.

406
00:14:30,858 --> 00:14:32,583
去你的 安迪·贝利
Damn you, Andy Bailey!

407
00:14:32,583 --> 00:14:34,297
他姓贝利吗
His last name is Bailey?

408
00:14:34,297 --> 00:14:37,427
老天啊 她以后要叫海莉·贝利了
Oh, my god, she's gonna be Haley Bailey.

409
00:14:39,500 --> 00:14:41,593
-等等 我想到一件事 -什么事
- Wait. I just thought of something. - What?

410
00:14:41,593 --> 00:14:43,128
我成了家里第一个
I'm going to be the first woman in my family

411
00:14:43,128 --> 00:14:45,301
没因为怀孕从大学退学的女人
not to get pregnant and drop out of college.

412
00:14:45,760 --> 00:14:47,653
也许我论文该写这个
Ooh, maybe that should be my essay.

413
00:14:47,653 --> 00:14:49,099
老娘大学毕业了啊
I graduated from college.

414
00:14:49,099 --> 00:14:50,674
没错 而且海莉退学时
Yeah, and haley got kicked out of college

415
00:14:50,674 --> 00:14:51,900
还没怀孕呢
before she got pregnant.

416
00:14:51,900 --> 00:14:55,837
等一下 亲爱的 我给你发张图片
Okay, hang on, honey. I am sending you a picture.

417
00:14:55,837 --> 00:14:59,465
你觉得这个纵火犯像留胡子的安迪吗
Do you think that this arsonist looks like Andy with a beard?

418
00:14:59,983 --> 00:15:02,226
不 他不是纵火犯
No. He's not an arsonist.

419
00:15:02,226 --> 00:15:04,080
歌洛莉亚请他照顾孩子呢
Gloria hired him to take care of her baby.

420
00:15:04,080 --> 00:15:05,695
对了 问问歌洛莉亚
Gloria. Right, of course.

421
00:15:05,695 --> 00:15:07,329
你知道她保护欲有多强
You know how protective she is.

422
00:15:07,329 --> 00:15:09,462
她肯定仔细查过他的底细
I'm sure she had him thoroughly vetted.

423
00:15:10,329 --> 00:15:11,057
你好
Hola!

424
00:15:11,057 --> 00:15:12,761
歌洛莉亚 你在哪找到的安迪
Gloria, where did you find Andy?

425
00:15:12,761 --> 00:15:14,954
公园里 当时他在追小孩
At the park, chasing some children.

426
00:15:14,954 --> 00:15:17,018
-天呐 -我再给他打电话
- Oh, my god. - I'm gonna call him again.

427
00:15:17,356 --> 00:15:18,662
老妈快看
Hey, mom, check it out.

428
00:15:18,662 --> 00:15:20,225
天呐 卢克你做了什么
God, Luke, what have you done?!

429
00:15:20,225 --> 00:15:22,918
就是 他有什么必要叛逆
I know. What does he have to rebel against?

430
00:15:22,918 --> 00:15:24,862
海莉怀孕 我留着莫霍克发型
Haley pregnant and me in a Mohawk --

431
00:15:24,862 --> 00:15:27,334
今年圣诞节贺卡的全家福我们无敌啦
This year's christmas card is gonna rule.

432
00:15:27,623 --> 00:15:28,969
进展如何 你找到她了吗
What's going on? Did you find her?

433
00:15:28,969 --> 00:15:32,258
没 爸 我没找到她 你知道吗
No, dad, no, I haven't found her. And you know what?

434
00:15:32,278 --> 00:15:33,275
这都是你的错
This is all your fault

435
00:15:33,275 --> 00:15:34,630
因为你们俩把
because you two introduced

436
00:15:34,630 --> 00:15:37,022
这个饥渴的陌生人带进了我们的生活
this horny stranger into our lives.

437
00:15:37,022 --> 00:15:38,029
让我搞搞清楚
Let me get this straight.

438
00:15:38,029 --> 00:15:39,793
你生气是因为你女儿怀孕
You're mad because your daughter got knocked up

439
00:15:39,793 --> 00:15:41,448
和一个猥琐男私奔
and ran off with some goofy guy

440
00:15:41,448 --> 00:15:43,202
然后背着你结婚
to get married behind your back.

441
00:15:43,202 --> 00:15:45,275
我都想象不到那是种什么感觉
I can't even imagine what that must feel like.

442
00:15:45,275 --> 00:15:46,531
真的 你现在要演这出
Really? Now?

443
00:15:46,531 --> 00:15:48,026
没有比现在更好的时机了
I can't think of a better time.

444
00:15:48,026 --> 00:15:50,598
杰 不要落进下石了
Jay, stop kicking her while she's down,

445
00:15:50,598 --> 00:15:52,422
也不要点破
pointing out her mistakes at the same time

446
00:15:52,422 --> 00:15:54,515
她众人皆知的错误
the whole universe is telling her

447
00:15:54,515 --> 00:15:56,269
她不就是个糟糕的母亲嘛
that she's a terrible mother!

448
00:15:56,269 --> 00:15:59,439
天呐 听不下去了 我挂了 拜拜
Oh, my god, okay, can't do this. Got to go. Bye.

449
00:16:33,079 --> 00:16:34,614
我想我的闺女
I miss my little girl!

450
00:16:34,614 --> 00:16:37,156
克莱尔 别那么做
Claire, don't do that.

451
00:16:37,415 --> 00:16:39,947
对 克莱尔 别那么做
Yes, Claire, don't do that!

452
00:16:40,595 --> 00:16:41,503
听着
Look...

453
00:16:41,651 --> 00:16:43,346
你闺女不在罐子底
You're not gonna find her at the bottom of that tin.

454
00:16:43,346 --> 00:16:45,040
你还没吃到罐子底 对吧
You're not near the bottom of that tin, are you?

455
00:16:45,040 --> 00:16:47,084
我要当外婆了
I'm gonna be a grandmother!

456
00:16:47,084 --> 00:16:48,539
没事的 宝贝
Aww, there, there, dear.

457
00:16:48,539 --> 00:16:49,825
好了 克莱尔
Okay, Claire...

458
00:16:50,044 --> 00:16:52,247
现在什么都还不确定
We don't know anything for sure yet.

459
00:16:52,526 --> 00:16:54,529
深呼吸
So take a deep breath...

460
00:16:55,217 --> 00:16:57,091
放下爆米花
...put the popcorn down...

461
00:16:57,440 --> 00:16:58,905
然后振...
And just get your...

462
00:17:01,437 --> 00:17:02,902
太不地道了 外婆
Not cool, grandma!

463
00:17:02,962 --> 00:17:05,444
好了 克莱尔 听我说
Okay, Claire, listen, listen.

464
00:17:05,444 --> 00:17:08,564
有时候生活给你你不想要的东西
Sometimes life hands you things that you don't want

465
00:17:08,564 --> 00:17:10,318
但最后你却发现那正是你需要的
and -- and they turn out to be exactly what you need.

466
00:17:10,318 --> 00:17:11,315
天呐
And, oh, my god,

467
00:17:11,315 --> 00:17:13,169
我刚刚说服自己喜欢上这顶帽子了
I think I just talked myself into liking this hat

468
00:17:13,169 --> 00:17:15,202
因为在屏幕上看到自己
because I keep seeing myself in it,

469
00:17:15,202 --> 00:17:17,624
我心里的潜台词是"这帅小伙是谁啊"
and I'm like, "Who is that handsome Yentl man?

470
00:17:17,624 --> 00:17:19,140
你没开玩笑吧
Are you serious right now?

471
00:17:20,624 --> 00:17:22,089
天呐 我得挂了
Oh, god, I got to go.

472
00:17:30,472 --> 00:17:33,412
对不起 我没帮上忙 你还好吗
I'm sorry. I wasn't that helpful. Are you okay?

473
00:17:33,412 --> 00:17:35,845
我们的女儿居然背着我们结婚了
Our little baby got married without us.

474
00:17:35,845 --> 00:17:37,569
我本应该送她出嫁的
I was supposed to give her away.

475
00:17:38,396 --> 00:17:39,483
我本应该牵着她的手走过红毯
I was supposed to walk her down the aisle

476
00:17:39,483 --> 00:17:41,765
然后对她的未来丈夫这样说
and give her husband-to-be one of these.

477
00:17:42,403 --> 00:17:43,919
她是我的宝贝女儿
"That's my baby girl.

478
00:17:44,566 --> 00:17:46,042
你一定要照顾好她
You take care of her."

479
00:17:46,161 --> 00:17:47,895
-没错 -那就是老爸该做的事
- Yeah. - 'Cause that's what dads do.

480
00:17:47,895 --> 00:17:48,762
我要给我爸打电话
I got to call my dad.

481
00:17:48,762 --> 00:17:49,311
拜托别告诉他
Please don't tell him

482
00:17:49,311 --> 00:17:51,065
她是在我的看管下离开的
I was in charge when she left.

483
00:17:54,494 --> 00:17:56,268
喂 看得到我吗
Hello. Can you see me?

484
00:17:56,268 --> 00:17:57,554
手指头 爸
Thumb, dad.

485
00:17:58,431 --> 00:17:59,856
他们淘汰老式旋转电话的那一刻
The minute they got rid of rotary phones,

486
00:17:59,856 --> 00:18:01,242
一切都完蛋了
everything went to hell.

487
00:18:01,242 --> 00:18:04,312
爸 真抱歉我以前私奔了
Dad, I'm really sorry that I eloped.

488
00:18:04,561 --> 00:18:06,146
你是个非常优秀的老爸
You were a great dad,

489
00:18:06,146 --> 00:18:08,139
你本该牵着我的手走过红毯
and you should've been there to walk me down the aisle,

490
00:18:08,139 --> 00:18:08,957
然后
and --

491
00:18:09,006 --> 00:18:11,807
我剥夺了你的这项权利 却从未道歉
and I've never apologized for taking that away from you.

492
00:18:11,807 --> 00:18:14,937
我们后来在夏威夷做过了 那也很好啊
Well, we got to do that thing in Hawaii, and that was nice.

493
00:18:14,937 --> 00:18:17,289
是 真是一报还一报啊
Yeah. Guess what goes around comes around, huh?

494
00:18:17,289 --> 00:18:20,469
你现在正处在龙卷风的中心
Look...you're in the eye of the tornado right now,

495
00:18:20,469 --> 00:18:21,725
除了看到你的生活席卷而来
and you can't see anything but

496
00:18:21,725 --> 00:18:23,728
其它都看不到
your life swirling around you.

497
00:18:24,227 --> 00:18:27,476
不过安迪是个好孩子 跟菲尔一样
But Andy's a good guy, just like Phil,

498
00:18:27,855 --> 00:18:30,975
多年以后 你可能会回首往事
and years from now, you might look back on this

499
00:18:30,975 --> 00:18:34,124
你会想 "最好的事情莫过于
and think, "The best thing that could've happened...

500
00:18:34,493 --> 00:18:37,055
那个傻瓜把我女儿的肚子搞大了"
was that dipstick knocking up my daughter."

501
00:18:38,699 --> 00:18:40,056
太感人了
That's so sweet.

502
00:18:40,135 --> 00:18:41,580
-他一直在听吗 -是的
- Was he listening?! - Yeah.

503
00:18:41,580 --> 00:18:43,125
这个傻瓜也爱你 杰
This dipstick loves you, too, Jay!

504
00:18:43,125 --> 00:18:44,371
我把刚才的话收回
I take it all back!

505
00:18:44,371 --> 00:18:46,195
-杰 -等一下 等一下
- Jay! - Wait a minute. Wait a minute.

506
00:18:46,195 --> 00:18:47,222
我试着搞定它
I am trying to fix it!

507
00:18:47,222 --> 00:18:50,112
歌洛莉亚在跟我说话 有些是英语
Gloria's talking to me. Some of it's in English.

508
00:18:50,272 --> 00:18:54,388
克莱尔你看 我把卢克的发型整好了
Claire, Claire! Look, look, I fix Luke's hair!

509
00:18:54,388 --> 00:18:56,162
老天呐 他看起来像善璞
Oh, my god, he looks like Shemp!

510
00:18:56,162 --> 00:18:57,608
好吧 是很像 不过
Okay, yes, it's true, but --

511
00:18:57,608 --> 00:19:00,339
也许如果我把这面再剪短一点...
but maybe if I cut a little bit more on the sides or in --

512
00:19:00,339 --> 00:19:01,814
不 不要 别再剪了
Oh, no, no, no. No more cutting.

513
00:19:01,814 --> 00:19:03,867
给我个机会习惯下就好了
Just give me a chance to get used to it.

514
00:19:04,794 --> 00:19:06,907
-是海莉 海莉打来了 -什么
- Oh, it's Haley! Haley's calling! - What?!

515
00:19:06,907 --> 00:19:09,231
妈妈
Hi, mom.

516
00:19:09,379 --> 00:19:09,871
就跟我说这个吗
"Hi, mom"?!

517
00:19:09,871 --> 00:19:12,808
我们一整天都试图联系你
We have been trying to get in touch with you all day!

518
00:19:12,808 --> 00:19:14,901
-我一直在床上 -天呐
- I've been in bed. - Oh, goodness.

519
00:19:14,901 --> 00:19:15,878
我们不需要听细节
I don't think we need to hear the details.

520
00:19:15,878 --> 00:19:18,818
海莉 我们都知道了
Haley... we know everything.

521
00:19:18,818 --> 00:19:20,593
我明白你为什么对我们隐瞒此事
And I understand why you hid it from us,

522
00:19:20,593 --> 00:19:23,413
尽管我们很不高兴 年轻的女士
and while we are not happy, young lady,

523
00:19:23,413 --> 00:19:24,859
我们可以一起想办法
we're gonna work this out.

524
00:19:24,859 --> 00:19:27,879
在我承认什么事之前
Uh, before I admit to anything,

525
00:19:27,879 --> 00:19:30,381
你能不能说得具体一点
maybe you could be more specific?

526
00:19:32,255 --> 00:19:34,109
海莉 你在家啊
Haley! You're home!

527
00:19:34,109 --> 00:19:36,351
是啊 我一整天都在家 一直在睡觉
Yeah, I've been home all day. I've been sleeping.

528
00:19:36,351 --> 00:19:37,913
这么说你没结婚
So, you didn't get married?!

529
00:19:37,913 --> 00:19:40,067
结婚 我为什么要结婚
Married?! Why would I get married?!

530
00:19:40,067 --> 00:19:42,073
因为你怀了安迪的孩子
Because you're pregnant with Andy's baby!

531
00:19:42,073 --> 00:19:44,512
什么 你为什么会那样想
What?! Why would you think that?!

532
00:19:44,512 --> 00:19:47,355
因为你的Facebook状态改成了已婚
Because you changed your Facebook status to "Married"

533
00:19:47,355 --> 00:19:48,412
而我们追踪你的手机
and then we tracked your cellphone

534
00:19:48,412 --> 00:19:50,405
到赌城的一间婚礼教堂
to a wedding chapel in Vegas.

535
00:19:50,445 --> 00:19:51,940
而且你还买了这本书
And you ordered this book!

536
00:19:51,940 --> 00:19:54,253
首先 这叫隐私
Wow, first of all, it's called privacy.

537
00:19:54,253 --> 00:19:54,861
不信去查
Google it.

538
00:19:54,861 --> 00:19:56,456
第二 我嫁给了一个甜甜圈
Second, I married a cronut.

539
00:19:56,456 --> 00:19:57,304
什么
What?

540
00:19:57,373 --> 00:20:00,173
昨晚 我的朋友安迪和我
Last night, my friend Andy and I,

541
00:20:00,173 --> 00:20:01,738
一起去买甜甜圈
we went to go get cronuts,

542
00:20:01,738 --> 00:20:03,154
我说那些甜甜圈太好吃了
and I said that they were so amazing,

543
00:20:03,154 --> 00:20:04,180
我真想嫁给它
I wanted to marry one,

544
00:20:04,180 --> 00:20:06,752
所以我当笑话发到Facebook上的
so I posted it on Facebook as a joke.

545
00:20:06,752 --> 00:20:09,244
后来我把手机落在安迪的车上了
Then I accidentally left my phone in Andy's car,

546
00:20:09,244 --> 00:20:11,666
他开车去赌城参加朋友的婚礼
which he drove to a friend's wedding in Vegas,

547
00:20:11,666 --> 00:20:14,008
那本书是给我的疯老板买的
and that book is for my crazy boss

548
00:20:14,008 --> 00:20:15,822
他在设计孕妇装
because he's designing maternity clothes

549
00:20:15,822 --> 00:20:17,676
想知道准妈妈们在想什么
and he wants to get inside the mind of preggos!

550
00:20:17,676 --> 00:20:18,703
谢天谢地
Thank god!

551
00:20:18,703 --> 00:20:20,946
真是松了一口气
I'm so relieved!

552
00:20:21,643 --> 00:20:22,421
等等
Wait a second.

553
00:20:22,421 --> 00:20:25,212
你怎么能看到我的Facebook页面
How did you get onto my Facebook page?

554
00:20:25,212 --> 00:20:26,647
我没加你好友
I unfriended you.

555
00:20:26,647 --> 00:20:27,953
那个布罗迪·肯德尔是她
She's Brody Kendall.

556
00:20:28,461 --> 00:20:29,807
天呐 真恶心
Oh, my god, gross!

557
00:20:29,807 --> 00:20:32,000
我居然一直在跟我妈玩糖果粉粹机
I've been playing Candy Crush with my mother!

558
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:33,655
你是怎么追踪到我的手机的
How did you track my phone?

559
00:20:33,764 --> 00:20:35,339
我觉得那并不怎么重要
Well, I don't think that really matters,

560
00:20:35,339 --> 00:20:37,053
而且我有充分的理由...
and there's a perfectly reasona--

561
00:20:41,708 --> 00:20:45,007
省省吧 我能看到你后面有人走过
Oh, cut it out. I can see people walking behind you.

562
00:20:46,024 --> 00:20:47,440
好了 我挂了
Okay, got to go.
